%N A398457 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(2*k) * H(k,2) / (2*k+1)^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th harmonic number of order 2.
